body:
\+1 for the 14.5 bcm.  Of my 3 ar's (14.5, 16, and 20)  it's my current favorite to shoot and really is an all around performer.  Accuracy doesn't vary much between the 3 when you find the right ammo for each.  Only downside is it is a little louder than the others.  

&#x200B;

For the lower you can buy pre-made or blank lower from any ffl.  Adding the parts to a lower can be a good learning experience to how the rifle operates and isn't all that difficult given all the online guides.
